WEBVTT

00:00:02.480 --> 00:00:06.490
Hagiwara Sakura. I choose you.

00:00:08.910 --> 00:00:11.200
W-What...?!

00:00:14.410 --> 00:00:18.160
Surgery

00:00:14.410 --> 00:00:18.160
Toyoda Misaki

00:00:15.120 --> 00:00:18.580
Looks like there's a lot of public attention.

00:00:18.790 --> 00:00:22.170
I can't fill the role of facing Jackall-<i>san.</i>

00:00:22.380 --> 00:00:25.510
Nonsense. This is your chance.

00:00:25.710 --> 00:00:28.130
Jackall-<i>san</i> is a wonderful person.

00:00:28.340 --> 00:00:30.220
Go and give it all you've got.

00:00:30.430 --> 00:00:31.850
But...

00:00:32.890 --> 00:00:36.770
Do you remember what I
always tell you before training?

00:00:37.940 --> 00:00:40.850
"Go into the ring for the win," was it?

00:00:41.060 --> 00:00:42.360
Right.

00:00:42.560 --> 00:00:45.530
No one goes into the ring to lose.

00:00:45.730 --> 00:00:49.030
Even when facing Jackall Tojo.

00:00:49.240 --> 00:00:51.450
What's important is the will to win.

00:00:51.660 --> 00:00:54.080
Sakura, go and win it!

00:00:55.290 --> 00:00:57.960
Win against Jackall-<i>san...</i>

00:01:01.080 --> 00:01:02.830
Follow me.

00:01:03.340 --> 00:01:05.840
<i>If only I could be more entranced</i>

00:01:06.050 --> 00:01:09.010
<i>Chasing my dream every day</i>

00:01:09.220 --> 00:01:17.640
<i>Ah, I could be proud with my flowing tears</i>

00:01:25.650 --> 00:01:30.900
<i>The feelings after frustration</i>

00:01:31.110 --> 00:01:36.410
<i>Are beyond my every choice</i>

00:01:36.620 --> 00:01:42.040
<i>Resolve myself to not accept losing</i>

00:01:42.250 --> 00:01:47.090
<i>Then stand up onto a new stage</i>

00:01:47.300 --> 00:01:52.630
<i>White, glistening sweat is beautiful</i>

00:01:52.840 --> 00:01:58.020
<i>I decided I'll live my life</i>

00:01:58.220 --> 00:02:00.890
<i>No matter how many times I fall</i>

00:02:01.100 --> 00:02:07.570
<i>If I stand up the same,</i>
<i>it will lead me to tomorrow</i>

00:02:07.770 --> 00:02:10.280
<i>With a strong feeling to not lose</i>

00:02:10.490 --> 00:02:13.490
<i>Say goodbye to the previous me</i>

00:02:13.700 --> 00:02:18.580
<i>A different me from yesterday is being born</i>

00:02:18.790 --> 00:02:21.410
<i>If only I could be more entranced</i>

00:02:21.620 --> 00:02:24.500
<i>Chasing my dream every day</i>

00:02:24.710 --> 00:02:32.010
<i>Ah, I could be proud with my flowing tears</i>

00:02:33.660 --> 00:02:35.740
The day has finally arrived!

00:02:34.130 --> 00:02:39.630
Episode 08: World Class Wrestling!

00:02:35.950 --> 00:02:38.620
The special match
commemorating Jackall Tojo's return!

00:02:38.830 --> 00:02:42.630
The match was placed on halt
from Toyoda Misaki's injuries

00:02:42.830 --> 00:02:44.840
but Jackall has named a new opponent

00:02:45.050 --> 00:02:49.300
and now, the gong to the
premier match is about to ring!

00:02:49.800 --> 00:02:51.090
Entering the blue corner is

00:02:51.300 --> 00:02:56.010
the national star idol, Hagiwara Sakura!

00:03:06.780 --> 00:03:09.030
Sakura-<i>chan</i>...!

00:03:14.780 --> 00:03:17.370
She better not screw this up...

00:03:26.500 --> 00:03:28.460
Next, entering the red corner is

00:03:28.670 --> 00:03:33.640
Shangri-La world champion, Jackall Tojo!

00:03:50.150 --> 00:03:52.650
The show must go on!

00:04:11.800 --> 00:04:14.840
In the blue corner,
we have the dancing top idol!

00:04:15.050 --> 00:04:20.930
The eternal center position,
Hagiwara Sakura...!

00:04:24.100 --> 00:04:27.110
In the red corner, we have
the Shangri-La world champion!

00:04:27.310 --> 00:04:33.820
The goddess of battle
dominating the world, Jackall Tojo...!

00:04:35.450 --> 00:04:37.070
What style!

00:04:37.280 --> 00:04:38.450
What beauty!

00:04:38.660 --> 00:04:41.750
A true goddess reigning atop the world

00:04:41.950 --> 00:04:44.920
has finally made her
appearance on the ring!

00:04:45.120 --> 00:04:50.050
I know I'm not in the
same league as Jackall-<i>san...</i>

00:04:50.250 --> 00:04:53.590
But, I'll still go for the win!

00:04:57.180 --> 00:05:01.770
Jackall deflected
Hagiwara's dropkick in mid-air!

00:05:01.970 --> 00:05:03.560
Was that supposed to be serious?

00:05:03.770 --> 00:05:05.770
Show me what you've got.

00:05:08.730 --> 00:05:11.070
What?! Is that it?!

00:05:11.940 --> 00:05:13.440
Why you!

00:05:20.490 --> 00:05:21.910
What?!

00:05:24.700 --> 00:05:27.620
The referee couldn't even put a count in!

00:05:27.830 --> 00:05:29.670
What a display of power from Jackall!

00:05:29.880 --> 00:05:31.250
I'm not done yet!

00:05:31.460 --> 00:05:32.880
Too weak!

00:05:47.440 --> 00:05:48.940
Hey! Give up?

00:05:49.150 --> 00:05:50.900
No...!

00:05:51.110 --> 00:05:53.530
Oh? How's this then?

00:05:53.730 --> 00:05:56.900
What's Jackall doing there?!

00:05:57.820 --> 00:06:00.160
It's the crossed arms Camel Clutch!

00:06:00.370 --> 00:06:03.580
The angle on the hold is set in deep!

00:06:04.240 --> 00:06:06.370
O-Ouch...!

00:06:08.170 --> 00:06:09.120
Owww...!

00:06:09.330 --> 00:06:15.300
The world champion's moves
are captivating the audience!

00:06:15.510 --> 00:06:16.720
Give up?

00:06:16.920 --> 00:06:18.590
N-No...!

00:06:19.430 --> 00:06:20.840
Okay!

00:06:24.350 --> 00:06:25.720
The Camel Clutch!

00:06:25.930 --> 00:06:28.730
Jackall Tojo, said to
hold a thousand moves,

00:06:28.940 --> 00:06:33.860
is resorting to basic moves today!

00:06:34.070 --> 00:06:36.400
Her harsh moves are as if to teach

00:06:36.610 --> 00:06:41.360
her prospect, Hagiwara,
the basics of pro wrestling!

00:06:41.570 --> 00:06:43.240
I can't breathe...!

00:06:43.450 --> 00:06:47.040
I didn't know the
Camel Clutch was this painful...!

00:06:47.950 --> 00:06:51.420
Jackall-<i>san</i> can get someone
to give up with the Camel Clutch.

00:06:51.630 --> 00:06:54.710
Sakura... now's the time to endure.

00:06:55.210 --> 00:06:59.930
What a rare variation to the Camel Clutch!

00:07:00.130 --> 00:07:03.300
Hagiwara's body is curled in tight!

00:07:03.510 --> 00:07:06.470
What skills from the world champ, Jackall!

00:07:06.680 --> 00:07:08.140
Hagiwara has got to be in pain!

00:07:08.350 --> 00:07:10.270
Ah...! Owww...!

00:07:10.480 --> 00:07:11.810
Give up?

00:07:12.020 --> 00:07:13.400
N-No!

00:07:13.610 --> 00:07:14.900
No?

00:07:15.110 --> 00:07:16.520
Okay!

00:07:18.990 --> 00:07:21.280
She's back in the Camel Clutch!

00:07:21.490 --> 00:07:24.490
She's continuing to put on
the pressure with her moves!

00:07:24.700 --> 00:07:26.410
My conscious... fading...

00:07:26.620 --> 00:07:28.750
I-I can't take this any more...!

00:07:35.920 --> 00:07:37.960
Here I go!

00:07:46.430 --> 00:07:48.350
Th-The pain...!

00:07:49.680 --> 00:07:51.310
I'm not done yet!

00:07:53.600 --> 00:07:55.520
O-Owww...!

00:07:57.110 --> 00:07:58.820
It hurts...!

00:07:59.030 --> 00:08:02.110
Three Indian deathlocks in a row!

00:08:02.320 --> 00:08:04.200
Jackall got the...

00:08:04.410 --> 00:08:05.620
- Give up?
- ...knees locked in!

00:08:05.820 --> 00:08:07.450
No! No...!

00:08:07.660 --> 00:08:08.790
No?

00:08:08.990 --> 00:08:10.410
Okay!

00:08:11.370 --> 00:08:13.370
Ow! Ow! Ow!

00:08:13.580 --> 00:08:15.540
Hey! C'mon guys!

00:08:15.750 --> 00:08:17.630
Hey! Hey! Hey! Hey!

00:08:17.840 --> 00:08:20.050
- Hey! Hey! Hey! C'mon!
- And here it is!
The champ, Jackall's true show!

00:08:20.260 --> 00:08:21.920
- Hey! Hey! Hey! Hey!
- And here it is!
The champ, Jackall's true show!

00:08:22.130 --> 00:08:24.220
- Hey! Hey! Hey! Let's go!
- Pro wrestling entertainment!

00:08:24.430 --> 00:08:26.550
- Hey! Hey! Hey! Hey!
- She's got her deathlock dance groove on!

00:08:26.760 --> 00:08:32.810
Amid the excitement,
Hagiwara is the only one in hell now!

00:08:33.020 --> 00:08:36.810
O-Ouch...! Owww...!

00:08:44.450 --> 00:08:48.030
It's a hanging leglock!

00:08:48.240 --> 00:08:50.370
That's got to be painful!

00:08:50.580 --> 00:08:52.250
No...!

00:08:53.040 --> 00:08:56.710
Ouch! Ow! Ow...!

00:09:00.210 --> 00:09:02.840
Ouch... Owww...!

00:09:05.590 --> 00:09:07.390
Hagiwara, give up?

00:09:07.590 --> 00:09:08.850
No...!

00:09:09.050 --> 00:09:10.470
Okay!

00:09:15.850 --> 00:09:17.690
What a harsh move!

00:09:17.900 --> 00:09:21.270
The world class
Boston Crab has got her good!

00:09:21.480 --> 00:09:22.690
I-I can't move...

00:09:22.900 --> 00:09:26.450
This is the most painful Boston Crab yet!

00:09:27.450 --> 00:09:32.620
Jackall-<i>san</i> would be able to
hold that move for the next hour.

00:09:32.830 --> 00:09:35.410
This is only going to get worse, Sakura...

00:09:35.620 --> 00:09:38.420
It hurts...! I can't move at all!

00:09:38.630 --> 00:09:42.460
What should I do...?! What...? What...?!

00:09:45.380 --> 00:09:45.970
Huh?

00:09:46.170 --> 00:09:48.010
She loosened her grip?

00:09:50.600 --> 00:09:51.930
Way to go, Hagiwara!

00:09:52.140 --> 00:09:54.180
Do your best, Hagiwara!

00:09:56.520 --> 00:09:58.440
Th-The pain...!

00:10:01.730 --> 00:10:04.730
It got looser...? Well then...!

00:10:10.820 --> 00:10:12.370
Rope!

00:10:12.580 --> 00:10:14.160
All right, Hagiwara!

00:10:14.370 --> 00:10:15.870
Way to make it through!

00:10:16.080 --> 00:10:18.830
Okay! Next, the legs!

00:10:31.260 --> 00:10:33.890
All right! Here I go...!

00:10:40.770 --> 00:10:42.520
Here's one in return!

00:10:44.610 --> 00:10:46.110
Why you...!

00:10:46.940 --> 00:10:49.950
Seeing that the Boston Crab won't work,

00:10:50.160 --> 00:10:53.950
Hagiwara went into
the single leg Boston Crab!

00:10:55.580 --> 00:10:59.910
What?! I can't stop her! She's too strong!

00:11:00.790 --> 00:11:02.670
Okay! Rope break!

00:11:05.920 --> 00:11:07.460
Well then...!

00:11:14.390 --> 00:11:17.720
There it is! The Sakura Special!

00:11:17.930 --> 00:11:23.690
But it wasn't enough to spiral Jackall!

00:11:24.310 --> 00:11:25.360
One...!

00:11:25.570 --> 00:11:26.980
Two...!

00:11:27.480 --> 00:11:30.110
Amazing! Not even
Hagiwara's special move,

00:11:30.320 --> 00:11:33.490
the Sakura Special,
was enough to take the win!

00:11:33.700 --> 00:11:37.290
With the amount of punishment
taken to her legs and waist,

00:11:37.490 --> 00:11:41.080
the Sakura Special won't
work on Jackall-<i>san</i>'s powerful body.

00:11:41.290 --> 00:11:45.710
Jackall-<i>san</i> knew that, so she took the hit...

00:11:46.590 --> 00:11:48.250
How about this...!

00:11:49.840 --> 00:11:53.640
Wait! Hagiwara's hold?! Could it be...?!

00:11:53.840 --> 00:11:55.800
The Misaki Special!

00:11:56.970 --> 00:11:58.600
A direct hit!

00:11:58.810 --> 00:12:01.640
Toyoda's feelings of not
being able to stand in the ring

00:12:01.850 --> 00:12:03.690
added power to that killer move!

00:12:03.900 --> 00:12:04.900
One...!

00:12:05.100 --> 00:12:06.060
Two...!

00:12:06.270 --> 00:12:08.230
The count at two and a half!

00:12:08.440 --> 00:12:12.490
Not even her tutor, Toyoda
Misaki's special move worked!

00:12:12.700 --> 00:12:14.950
Has Hagiwara used all her cards?!

00:12:15.160 --> 00:12:19.700
The Sakura Special and
Misaki Special didn't work...?

00:12:19.910 --> 00:12:24.120
The person in front of me
is the real world champion!

00:12:25.080 --> 00:12:28.460
Still... I need to go for the win!

00:12:29.460 --> 00:12:31.210
Another Misaki Special?

00:12:31.420 --> 00:12:35.260
Doesn't she know that it won't work on me?

00:12:39.930 --> 00:12:41.600
It isn't the Misaki Special?!

00:12:41.810 --> 00:12:43.730
What is this...?!

00:12:48.460 --> 00:12:52.090
This is the Misaki Special - Two!

00:12:54.340 --> 00:12:56.970
It... It's a new move!

00:12:57.170 --> 00:12:58.800
She made it seem like the Misaki Special

00:12:59.010 --> 00:13:02.350
but instead slammed
her at an angle to the ring!

00:13:02.550 --> 00:13:06.470
Jackall took the feint,
and went in head first!

00:13:08.730 --> 00:13:10.980
This is the... Misaki Special - Two?

00:13:11.190 --> 00:13:12.230
Right...

00:13:12.440 --> 00:13:16.530
It's a special move I
prepared to face Jackall-<i>san.</i>

00:13:16.730 --> 00:13:19.780
Sakura, go ahead and use it.

00:13:19.990 --> 00:13:21.740
Misaki-<i>san...</i>

00:13:21.950 --> 00:13:27.750
If you succeed using
this in Jackall-<i>san</i>'s match...

00:13:27.950 --> 00:13:30.000
then you should be able to see

00:13:30.210 --> 00:13:31.540
the world.

00:13:31.750 --> 00:13:33.540
The world...?

00:13:34.130 --> 00:13:36.380
You could say, "future" instead.

00:13:36.590 --> 00:13:37.800
Jackall isn't standing up!

00:13:38.010 --> 00:13:41.260
Hagiwara goes in for the pin!
Is this going to be a major upset?!

00:13:41.470 --> 00:13:42.590
One...!

00:13:42.800 --> 00:13:44.260
Two...!

00:13:45.100 --> 00:13:46.640
The count was inches away from a three!

00:13:46.850 --> 00:13:48.730
Jackall still got through this new move!

00:13:48.930 --> 00:13:54.110
But Hagiwara did push the
world champion to a close loss!

00:13:54.310 --> 00:13:57.070
This is awesome!
Jackall is being pressured!

00:13:57.280 --> 00:14:00.780
This match may become
the biggest upset in history!

00:14:00.990 --> 00:14:05.740
W-Wow! This is almost
like Shangri-La's official match!

00:14:05.950 --> 00:14:09.580
I can do this! I'll finish this match!

00:14:14.670 --> 00:14:19.460
It can't be... After all those
moves, it still isn't fazing her!

00:14:20.130 --> 00:14:22.680
Thanks for showing me your moves.

00:14:22.880 --> 00:14:25.510
Now it's payback time.

00:14:27.140 --> 00:14:28.850
Here we go!

00:14:32.440 --> 00:14:34.980
Savor this!

00:14:35.190 --> 00:14:39.190
It's Jackall's special move, the Piledriver!

00:14:40.570 --> 00:14:44.240
The hold is long! Way too long!

00:14:44.450 --> 00:14:47.580
The blood is... running to my head...!

00:14:51.290 --> 00:14:52.540
What power!

00:14:52.750 --> 00:14:57.540
One hit put the stop on Hagiwara!

00:14:57.750 --> 00:14:58.710
One...!

00:14:58.920 --> 00:15:02.130
I-I can't get her off! I need to move...!

00:15:02.340 --> 00:15:04.010
I don't want to lose!

00:15:05.550 --> 00:15:08.390
Hagiwara pumped herself out of the pin!

00:15:09.510 --> 00:15:10.930
One...!

00:15:12.560 --> 00:15:15.440
- One...!
- Jackall isn't giving up!

00:15:15.650 --> 00:15:17.270
- Two...!
- The pressure from her pins..

00:15:17.480 --> 00:15:20.020
...is taking its toll!

00:15:22.070 --> 00:15:25.700
Hagiwara went face
down to avoid the pins!

00:15:25.910 --> 00:15:31.240
But that only welcomed
in Jackall's Camel Clutch!

00:15:31.450 --> 00:15:35.580
With how tired she is,
she won't get a single breath in!

00:15:35.790 --> 00:15:39.170
My breath...! I can't breathe...!

00:15:40.340 --> 00:15:42.550
It's... show time!

00:15:47.930 --> 00:15:49.930
She's got her up with one leg!

00:15:50.140 --> 00:15:53.060
It's a torturing Bow and Arrow!

00:15:53.270 --> 00:15:57.020
Is Jackall going for
gold by making her give up?!

00:15:57.230 --> 00:15:59.650
That's got to be painful!

00:16:00.190 --> 00:16:01.820
G-Give...

00:16:04.860 --> 00:16:07.450
What?! Jackall let her go?!

00:16:07.660 --> 00:16:09.450
Let's party!

00:16:09.660 --> 00:16:13.080
Jackall is signaling for her finisher!

00:16:15.160 --> 00:16:16.290
There it is!

00:16:16.500 --> 00:16:20.080
The Jackall Meteor Suplex!

00:16:23.630 --> 00:16:25.130
One...!

00:16:25.340 --> 00:16:27.050
I can't get her off...!

00:16:27.260 --> 00:16:28.970
Two...!

00:16:29.180 --> 00:16:30.680
She loosened her pin?!

00:16:31.760 --> 00:16:36.310
Hagiwara comes right
back on a two and a half count!

00:16:36.520 --> 00:16:39.520
She got out of that?! Amazing!

00:16:39.730 --> 00:16:42.320
It's been a while since I've
seen such an exciting match!

00:16:42.520 --> 00:16:43.940
Jackall's the bomb!

00:16:44.150 --> 00:16:46.740
Hey, Hagiwara's showing her stuff too!

00:16:49.200 --> 00:16:52.660
W-Wait! Jackall's set up here...!

00:16:52.870 --> 00:16:54.410
Could it be...?!

00:16:54.620 --> 00:16:56.950
All finished!

00:16:57.210 --> 00:17:00.380
It's Jackall's finisher hold!

00:17:00.580 --> 00:17:02.880
The Jackall Comet Buster!

00:17:03.090 --> 00:17:05.630
Will that end the match?!

00:17:05.840 --> 00:17:07.470
One...!

00:17:07.670 --> 00:17:09.340
Two...!

00:17:09.550 --> 00:17:10.970
Thr...

00:17:15.470 --> 00:17:19.020
Hagiwara gets back up
from Jackall's finisher hold!

00:17:19.230 --> 00:17:20.850
Unbelievable!

00:17:21.060 --> 00:17:25.400
Who would have expected
an exciting match like this?!

00:17:26.400 --> 00:17:28.950
I knew I made the right choice...

00:17:29.740 --> 00:17:32.620
You're the same as us!

00:17:32.820 --> 00:17:36.700
One of the select few,
able to make people dream!

00:17:36.910 --> 00:17:40.540
Could this be...?
Is it finally going to come?!

00:17:40.750 --> 00:17:43.540
I'll send you... to kingdom come!

00:17:43.750 --> 00:17:46.250
Go to Heaven!

00:17:49.010 --> 00:17:52.510
There it is...! The Jackall Super Galaxy!

00:17:52.720 --> 00:17:58.270
The move that defeated
her Shangri-La opponents!

00:17:59.270 --> 00:18:02.270
Stand up...! Hagiwara...!

00:18:02.480 --> 00:18:03.650
One...!

00:18:03.860 --> 00:18:05.770
Sakura-<i>chan</i>...!

00:18:05.980 --> 00:18:08.530
Two...!

00:18:08.740 --> 00:18:10.450
Three!

00:18:11.990 --> 00:18:13.490
Way to go, Jackall!

00:18:13.700 --> 00:18:15.700
Now that's what world class is about!

00:18:15.910 --> 00:18:18.330
Sakura-<i>chan</i>... faced the world champ...

00:18:18.540 --> 00:18:20.500
Yes! Yes! She did her best...!

00:18:20.710 --> 00:18:25.460
The world champion
and national star idol match...

00:18:25.670 --> 00:18:31.130
...has ended with the
champion, Jackall, in domination!

00:18:31.340 --> 00:18:34.510
Thanks! This was a really fun match!

00:18:34.720 --> 00:18:36.350
How about you all?!

00:18:42.770 --> 00:18:44.270
Jackall Tojo...

00:18:44.480 --> 00:18:47.570
This is the world champion's power...

00:18:47.770 --> 00:18:50.110
Jackall-<i>san</i> let me loose a number of times

00:18:50.320 --> 00:18:53.740
to give me a chance to shine.

00:18:53.950 --> 00:18:59.870
She was showing me
how to entertain the audience.

00:19:00.500 --> 00:19:05.170
It's frustrating... to see
how much stronger the world is.

00:19:05.960 --> 00:19:08.340
But, what's this feeling I have?

00:19:08.540 --> 00:19:13.720
I'm frustrated, but the
satisfaction and excitement is amazing!

00:19:14.380 --> 00:19:15.260
Now then...

00:19:15.470 --> 00:19:20.220
I think you have something
to say to the audience.

00:19:20.430 --> 00:19:21.930
Jackall-<i>san...</i>

00:19:22.140 --> 00:19:22.680
Sakura!

00:19:22.890 --> 00:19:25.310
If you're a pro wrestler...

00:19:25.520 --> 00:19:28.730
...stand on your own two feet, Sakura!

00:19:28.940 --> 00:19:30.860
Y-Yes!

00:19:38.410 --> 00:19:42.290
I was very worried about this match.

00:19:42.500 --> 00:19:48.250
But, Jackall-<i>san</i> accepted
me and took me on directly.

00:19:48.460 --> 00:19:54.050
I appreciate every moment
of this dreamy experience I had.

00:19:54.260 --> 00:19:56.800
I had a chance to see the world today.

00:19:57.010 --> 00:20:00.180
I saw that my road
ahead was still far and harsh.

00:20:00.390 --> 00:20:01.100
But...

00:20:01.310 --> 00:20:04.480
I don't want to stop!

00:20:04.680 --> 00:20:09.400
I love the pro wrestling
that made me who I am today!

00:20:09.610 --> 00:20:12.730
Jackall-<i>san</i>! I'll take
a win from you one day!

00:20:13.610 --> 00:20:15.030
I...

00:20:16.200 --> 00:20:19.950
I... wanna be the strongest in the world!

00:20:23.330 --> 00:20:27.080
If you want to beat me,
you'll have to come to Shangri-La.

00:20:27.290 --> 00:20:29.210
I'll be eagerly waiting.

00:20:31.130 --> 00:20:32.380
Jackall-<i>san...</i>

00:20:32.590 --> 00:20:35.010
One day...!

00:20:39.760 --> 00:20:41.720
That new move hit hard.

00:20:41.930 --> 00:20:44.140
You're the one who taught her that, right?

00:20:44.350 --> 00:20:47.060
You can see through me like glass.

00:20:48.230 --> 00:20:49.810
Thank you very much.

00:20:50.020 --> 00:20:52.860
This was a valuable experience for Sakura.

00:20:53.070 --> 00:20:55.780
The pleasure's all mine.

00:20:55.990 --> 00:20:59.030
I experienced something valuable too.

00:20:59.240 --> 00:21:01.030
What do you mean?

00:21:01.240 --> 00:21:02.450
Did you notice?

00:21:02.660 --> 00:21:06.950
The Jackall Comet Buster
was supposed to finish the match.

00:21:07.160 --> 00:21:11.630
But... Sakura got out on her own from that.

00:21:12.540 --> 00:21:16.920
She went above and beyond
my expectations at the last minute.

00:21:17.130 --> 00:21:20.340
I'm happy to see you've
got a good wrestler under you.

00:21:20.550 --> 00:21:25.060
She may have it in her
to surpass both you and me.

00:21:25.260 --> 00:21:26.680
Yes!

00:21:30.520 --> 00:21:32.770
Wow... That was extreme!

00:21:32.980 --> 00:21:36.360
Pro wrestling is so exciting!

00:21:40.540 --> 00:21:46.160
<i>The scab from my bruised knees</i>

00:21:46.370 --> 00:21:51.920
<i>always disappears without a trace.</i>

00:21:52.120 --> 00:21:56.840
<i>It's the same with the scars to my heart.</i>

00:21:57.050 --> 00:22:01.720
<i>Tomorrow's dream is my salve.</i>

00:22:01.930 --> 00:22:03.180
<i>So</i>

00:22:03.390 --> 00:22:08.770
<i>even if I'm in pain,</i>
<i>I look up to the skies and</i>

00:22:08.980 --> 00:22:14.400
<i>yell with all my might</i>
<i>in a murmur "I'll do this!"</i>

00:22:14.610 --> 00:22:19.690
<i>I want my resolve to be heard</i>

00:22:19.900 --> 00:22:25.320
<i>by the weak me of today.</i>

00:22:25.530 --> 00:22:32.790
<i>I want to fully praise</i>
<i>myself for doing my best</i>

00:22:33.000 --> 00:22:36.630
<i>after I get past this wall.</i>

00:22:36.840 --> 00:22:41.220
<i>Even if I fall if I can once more</i>

00:22:41.420 --> 00:22:47.930
<i>get myself up, I can walk again.</i>

00:22:48.140 --> 00:22:58.140
<i>See? The more you believe in your dreams,</i>

00:22:59.230 --> 00:23:05.870
<i>shine keeps shining.</i>

00:23:10.070 --> 00:23:34.680
Episode 09: The Amazing Newcomer!

00:23:10.350 --> 00:23:12.810
I've got another hot scoop for you, Chief!

00:23:13.020 --> 00:23:16.190
Another super prospect joined Berserk!

00:23:16.400 --> 00:23:18.150
Her name's Fukuoka Moe!

00:23:18.360 --> 00:23:20.820
To add, she's still a high school student!

00:23:21.030 --> 00:23:23.070
And a world champion of karate at that!

00:23:23.280 --> 00:23:25.700
She's a bit on the wild side, but

00:23:25.910 --> 00:23:29.000
her strong will is sure to make her a beast!

00:23:29.210 --> 00:23:32.380
This bombshell's wild love to Sakura is gonna be

00:23:32.580 --> 00:23:34.500
one to watch out for! Check it!

00:23:34.680 --> 00:23:39.680
A request from Sakura:

00:23:34.680 --> 00:23:39.680
There are a lot of pro wrestling moves in "Sekatsuyo,"
but they're dangerous, so please don't try them at home!
